      "id": "livelihood-textbooks-publicity-insurance",
      "locator": "Printed337–338 / PDF345–346",
      "evidence_type": "Author retrospective first-person memoir",
      "paraphrase": "He recalls income from textbook writing, Eastern States publicity work and life-insurance business during an improved financial period. He describes textbook publishers bringing money and an insurance commission.",
